WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Steps and a palm tree outside the main entrance.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Round blue tables and small chairs in the activity room.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Rows of monitors and keyboards in the computer lab.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Glassware, stands and a sink on the science bench.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Tree shadows fall across the blue basketball court beside the school building.
